'''Draugr''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in [[Swamp|Swamps]] and in [[Draugr village|Draugr villages]], [[Sunken Crypts]] and sometimes [[Mountain]] towers. They are ancient undead Vikings that have since become bloated in appearance.

