== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Draugr|Aggressive creature strategies#Draugr}}Draugr come in two variants: 75% of them are equipped with axes and the other 25% have bows.

=== Axe ===
Does a horizontal slash that extends 2.2 meters and arcs 90 degrees (48 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] and 15 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] damage). This attack has a 3-second cooldown and can be used within 1.6 meters of a player.

=== Bow ===
Nocks an arrow and shoots the player (48 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]] damage). The arrow travels at 30 meters per second for up to 4 seconds before despawning and has a spread of 2–20 degrees. This attack has a 4-second cooldown and can be used within 20 meters of a player.

